DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-21T04:30:00&endDate=2026-11-23T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nLIONESS LINE: Saturday 21 and Sunday 22 November\, no service between Euston and Watford Junction. There will also be no BAKERLOO LINE service between Queens Park and Harrow & Wealdstone. Special bus service 720 operates (please note service 718 will NOT operate). LONDON NORTH WESTERN RAILWAY trains continue to serve Euston\, Harrow & Wealdstone\, Bushey and Watford Junction. SOUTHERN trains serve Wembley Central\, Harrow & Wealdstone and Watford Junction until 1900 only.
